' Beryllium (hcp) iel=10 mode-0 + crystalline EXTINCTION (example)'/
'                                                                 '/
' This deck adds the OPTIONAL extinction card (line ~11):         '/
'   extinction BC_mix l=8550 g=170 L=75750 dist=Gauss rec=std ... '/
' which applies a Becker-Coppens extinction reduction to the      '/
' coherent-elastic Bragg comb (MF7/MT2). Extinction is a SAMPLE   '/
' property: l=crystallite size [A], g=mosaic [rad^-1], L=grain    '/
' size [A] come from a fit-to-transmission or microstructure, not '/
' from the material. Omit the card for the ideal-crystal tape.    '/
'                                                                 '/
' Models/recipes are ported from the NCrystal CrysXT plugin;      '/
' see Kittelmann et al. Acta Cryst. (2026) A82 163 and Xu et al.  '/
' J. Appl. Cryst. (2025) 58 1957. The cell matches Be_sg194.ncmat.'/
' --------------------------------------------------------------- '/
/
